  "caveats": [
    "The baseline here is the same engine with the drafter off, not stock llama.cpp. The 33 tok/s ceiling is for undrafted decode (10.5 GB per token at 342 GB/s).",
    "Not measured past 26k tokens of context, where most of the K/V cache is read from RAM.",
    "Answer quality was not measured here; the card's HumanEval and AppWorld numbers are the author's.",
    "The bundle's launcher detaches, so serve.sh waits on the engine to keep a GPU queue lock held."
  ],
